===Determiner===
{{en-head|det}}

# [[all|All]]; [[every]]; {{non-gloss|qualifying a singular noun, indicating all examples of the thing so named seen as individual or separate items (compare {{m|en|every}})}}.
#: {{ux|en|Make sure you wash '''each''' bowl well.}}
#: {{ux|en|The sun comes up '''each''' morning and sets '''each''' night.}}
